WEBVTT

00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:17.030
(screaming)

00:00:23.036 --> 00:00:24.329
Give the order.

00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:28.417
My men are still down there.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.172
(man) Draw back! Get out! Retreat!

00:00:35.674 --> 00:00:36.758
Now!

00:00:40.846 --> 00:00:42.931
Fire!

00:01:04.828 --> 00:01:07.998
(man) Run for your life!
Save yourself!

00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:24.181
(Reepicheep) Peter! The bridge!

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:41.990
(man) Leave us! Go, brothers!

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:46.578
(creature) In the name of Aslan!

00:01:57.881 --> 00:02:00.634
(silence)

00:02:44.386 --> 00:02:46.221
What happened?

00:02:46.305 --> 00:02:48.056
Ask him.

00:02:48.682 --> 00:02:51.268
- Peter.
- Me?

00:02:51.351 --> 00:02:53.854
You could've called it off.
There was time.

00:02:53.937 --> 00:02:55.522
No, there wasn't, thanks to you.

00:02:55.605 --> 00:02:58.525
If you kept to the plan,
those soldiers might be alive.

00:02:58.608 --> 00:03:01.361
If you'd stayed here like I suggested,
they definitely would be!

00:03:01.445 --> 00:03:05.532
- You called us, remember?
- My first mistake.

00:03:05.615 --> 00:03:08.744
No. Your first mistake was thinking
you could lead these people.

00:03:08.827 --> 00:03:10.412
Hey!

00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:15.500
I am not the one
who abandoned Narnia.

00:03:15.584 --> 00:03:20.005
You invaded Narnia. You have no more
right to lead it than Miraz does.

00:03:20.088 --> 00:03:24.885
You, him, your father... Narnia's
better off without the lot of you.

00:03:24.968 --> 00:03:27.471
- (screaming)
- (Edmund) Stop it!

00:04:03.298 --> 00:04:05.467
(gasping)

00:04:08.637 --> 00:04:11.223
What are you all
standing around for?

00:04:13.558 --> 00:04:16.103
Telmarines will
be here soon enough.

00:04:18.939 --> 00:04:22.526
Thank you... my dear little friend.

00:04:28.365 --> 00:04:32.828
- Well done, lads.
- Move it faster, mate. Too slow!

00:04:42.587 --> 00:04:45.173
(man) Beruna pledges its troops.

00:04:45.257 --> 00:04:49.136
(man 2) Galma pledges its troops.

00:04:49.219 --> 00:04:52.139
(man 3) Tashbaan pledges its troops.

00:04:52.222 --> 00:04:55.892
(man 4) Ettinsmoor pledges its troops.

00:05:25.505 --> 00:05:29.593
(chanting) Long live the king!
Long live the king!

00:05:33.555 --> 00:05:35.765
(crowd continues chanting)

